### UC15 order-level first review
POST http://localhost:8080/api/order/1501/review/items
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"items":[{"productType":"NEW","productId":1501,"score":5,"content":"首评内容"},{"productType":"NEW","productId":1502,"score":4,"content":"另一件商品"}]}

### UC15 seller reply
POST http://localhost:8080/api/review/{{reviewId}}/reply
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reply":"感谢反馈"}

### UC15 buyer follow-up
POST http://localhost:8080/api/review/followup
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"orderId":1501,"productType":"NEW","productId":1501,"score":5,"content":"追评内容"}
